  body: "# Evidence of funeral-payment responsibility\n\n## Authored interpretation\n\nThe funeral-payment guidance
    treats a contract, invoice and agency evidence as ways to establish responsibility, with different treatment
    of a signed estimate and an unsigned estimate.\n\n## Scope and exceptions\n\nDMG 39137 crosses pages 10–11:
    an unsigned estimate is expressly insufficient by itself. Novation is a separate legal transfer question. The
    project records evidence categories only; it does not request claimants’ contracts or decide liability.\n\n\
    ## Inspected passages\n\n- [DMG 39137, PDF page 10](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68da370d360fa159c37c47/dmg-v-7-ch-39.pdf#page=10).\n\
    - [DMG 39138, PDF page 11](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68da370d360fa159c37c47/dmg-v-7-ch-39.pdf#page=11).\n\
    - [DMG 39139, PDF page 11](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68da370d360fa159c37c47/dmg-v-7-ch-39.pdf#page=11).\n\
    - [DMG 39141, PDF page 11](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68da370d360fa159c37c47/dmg-v-7-ch-39.pdf#page=11).\n\
    \n## Additional context\n\n- [Context: chapter 39, PDF page 11](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68da370d360fa159c37c47/dmg-v-7-ch-39.pdf#page=11).\n\
    \n## Evidence and review status\n\nIndependent experimental interpretation of captured DWP guidance, not an
    official DWP document. Definitions and semantic associations are model-assisted proposals awaiting specialist
    review. No individual entitlement decision, medical conclusion, award calculation or executable rule is provided.\n\
    \nSource observation, listing-page update, printed revision, legal event and claimant-event dates are separate.
    Current legal applicability is unresolved. Page numbers are one-based PDF positions; machine extraction may
    damage reading order, characters and footnotes. No visual PDF or specialist acceptance is claimed.\n\n- `dmg-vol7-ch39`:
    PDF `ab13db0cf4d33fd90fb4cd8a90b909af568d39169f617f4b86b1037278d3fa9f`; extracted pages `625425d7933417f8895628354b1be65fc86df4d1f97a55acb13426d6cbe2b8a7`;
    acquired `2026-09-15T19:45:28.411887Z`.\n"
  resource: https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68da370d360fa159c37c47/dmg-v-7-ch-39.pdf#page=10
